Cell["\<\
An option to use the Parthenope rates for d + d <-> t + p and d + d <-> n + \
He3. If it is true, then the codes uses TabulatedReactionsFileParthenope or \
TabulatedReactionsFileSmallNetworkParthenope if the small network option (see \
below) is True.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.936844755709506*^9, 
